{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号标题首先进入视线，紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”和“不自在了呢”最醒目；随后中间白色大句、下方黄色强调句也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他开始担心对方有一天不再需要自己陪，甚至不愿意和自己待在一起。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安、忐忑。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他已经因此安静下来，刚才还敢期待，现在却不敢继续往下想；现实中对方一直没有退开，两人仍然亲近，这些都是真的，他也因此有一点高兴。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的大字争夺主视线：上方紫色标题、中间白色大句、下方黄色强调句。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：担心什么在顶部，眼下的反应在中间，现实中的亲近和一点高兴在底部。\",\n    \"顶部标题本身较长，既有情绪判断，也有具体的假设情境，需要读完才能明确两者的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e542b13-2f79-4631-9616-a3f8e47064ae", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011224504147Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:12:59.308066+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "94f025e8abc17748f8370640d866c503af9ad0b45c5380792b03e2bae544d835", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33c